1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:39,364
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,479
Look.

4
00:00:41,799 --> 00:00:42,719
It's dawn.

5
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,780
How do you feel now?

6
00:00:52,659 --> 00:00:53,219
Pretty good.

7
00:00:54,659 --> 00:00:55,899
You picked a great spot.

8
00:01:06,579 --> 00:01:07,299
Then,

9
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,299
can I stop calling you sis?

10
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:13,579
Don't push your luck.

11
00:01:15,659 --> 00:01:16,260
But

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,760
I'll allow it for now.

13
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:24,319
All right.

14
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:25,599
Let's pack up.

15
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:26,760
Time to get back to work.

16
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,000
No matter how bad things get,

17
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:30,280
we still have to work.

18
00:01:30,459 --> 00:01:31,200
Life goes on.

19
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,159
About the leak...

20
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,879
Any leads?

21
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,239
I really don't think it was Gu Yuan.

22
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,079
Anyone who can take me on

23
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:42,980
wouldn't be so amateurish.

24
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:45,920
I know how to find the culprit.

25
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:46,920
But

26
00:01:47,739 --> 00:01:48,599
I'll need your help.

27
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,560
Hey, with what?

28
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:55,480
I'll tell you when we get back.

29
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,519
Let's enjoy the sunshine for now.

30
00:02:01,739 --> 00:02:02,620
Here I come!

31
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:09,180
Getting bold, huh?

32
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:24,580
Ms. Wen.

33
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,560
I need to tell you something.

34
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,120
What is it?

35
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,479
Ms. Wang called me yesterday.

36
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,159
There's something

37
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,879
Mr. Zhao mustn't find out.

38
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,680
Apparently,

39
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,240
she started seeing someone recently.

40
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,520
They were already separated by then,

41
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:43,000
but not legally divorced.

42
00:02:43,379 --> 00:02:44,860
She's afraid he'll use it against her

43
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:46,060
in the asset division.

44
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,680
Who else knows?

45
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,759
No one. Just us.

46
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:52,419
Then keep it to yourself.

47
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,599
If this gets out, we're in trouble.

48
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,879
Understood.

49
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,240
This restaurant...

50
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,240
It took ages to get a reservation.

51
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,080
Thank you.

52
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,280
It's just my kind of place.

53
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:17,960
Good, right?

54
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,960
This wine is really good.

55
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:29,740
Mr. Liu.

56
00:03:30,379 --> 00:03:31,659
You took this photo, didn't you?

57
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,539
Mr. Zhao used it to threaten Ms. Wang.

58
00:03:34,539 --> 00:03:35,840
He says she's at fault too

59
00:03:35,939 --> 00:03:37,500
and wants the assets redivided.

60
00:03:57,180 --> 00:03:58,439
I don't know what you mean.

61
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,900
When Chen and I discussed this,

62
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:02,759
you were there.

63
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:03,500
Yes.

64
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:04,580
I remember

65
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:06,020
you looking over at us.

66
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,439
That's absurd.

67
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,479
Everyone was there.

68
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:13,319
You can't just say I took it.

69
00:04:13,659 --> 00:04:14,620
Do you have any proof?

70
00:04:15,219 --> 00:04:16,240
Security footage?

71
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:18,899
Let me ask you.

72
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,920
Do you even know

73
00:04:21,579 --> 00:04:23,180
the man in that photo?

74
00:04:23,579 --> 00:04:24,240
Who is he?

75
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,980
You don't know him,

76
00:04:26,259 --> 00:04:26,819
do you?

77
00:04:28,860 --> 00:04:31,399
You just saw a strange man

78
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,800
having dinner with Ms. Wang

79
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:34,259
and thought you had dirt on her.

80
00:04:34,259 --> 00:04:36,600
But you never checked who he was.

81
00:04:38,339 --> 00:04:39,500
He's my friend.

82
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,040
That dinner?

83
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:44,439
I sent him there.

84
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,660
I staged it all for you.

85
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,379
I planned every step.

86
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,959
I wanted to see

87
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:50,720
if you were

88
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,560
the source of the leak.

89
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,079
On Thursday, Mr. Zhao
transferred 200,000 yuan

90
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:56,959
into your wife's account,

91
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:58,100
(ICBC)
noted as "consulting fee."

92
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:59,160
How do you explain that?

93
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,040
What's going on?

94
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,439
Mr. Lin.

95
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,699
I know you're biased against me,

96
00:05:11,459 --> 00:05:13,279
but Mr. Liu betrayed this firm.

97
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:14,920
Leaking client information

98
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,819
can get you suspended

99
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,620
or end your career entirely.

100
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,860
You know the risks

101
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,240
better than I do.

102
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,160
Is this true?

103
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:34,959
You're suspended.

104
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,000
Hand over your cases.

105
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:37,899
The disciplinary committee will step in
to investigate tomorrow.

106
00:05:37,899 --> 00:05:38,540
We'll also

107
00:05:38,939 --> 00:05:40,759
notify the Justice Bureau
and the Bar Association.

108
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,600
Mr. Lin.

109
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,860
I've worked for you for over ten years!

110
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:46,339
Exactly. Over ten years.

111
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,199
I never thought

112
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,939
you'd sink this low.

113
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:51,480
You knew the risks

114
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:54,959
when you did it, didn't you?

115
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,079
Ms. Wen.

116
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,279
You're amazing.

117
00:06:36,893 --> 00:06:38,280
(Cheng A J5630)

118
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,920
What brings you here?

119
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,939
I couldn't find you at your office.

120
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,560
I brought egg tarts.

121
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,060
They're fine this time.

122
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:49,959
Not squashed.

123
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,459
Aren't you tired from all that queuing?

124
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:58,000
To celebrate you finally
dealing with that jerk.

125
00:07:02,579 --> 00:07:03,079
How about a walk?

126
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:11,379
What's wrong?

127
00:07:11,899 --> 00:07:13,779
You seem a little off today.

128
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:18,740
A little girl came in today.

129
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,959
Xiaoyu. Just 9 years old.

130
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,720
Her dad works at a site
on the east side of town.

131
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,639
She went to see him after school.

132
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:29,240
A steel pipe fell from above

133
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:30,839
and hit her right leg and ribs.

134
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,040
When she arrived,

135
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:36,600
she had an open fracture
in her right leg

136
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:38,120
and three broken ribs.

137
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,720
One nearly pierced her spleen.

138
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:44,800
We operated for four hours.

139
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,600
Bone realignment,

140
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:47,600
internal fixation,

141
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,019
and spleen repair.

142
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,500
The surgery went well.

143
00:07:52,579 --> 00:07:53,759
But she's still

144
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,600
in intensive care.

145
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,300
She's not out of danger yet.

146
00:07:58,399 --> 00:08:00,040
The contractor dropped her off and left.

147
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,180
Said it wasn't the site's fault,

148
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:04,420
that she'd wandered in herself.

149
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,680
He didn't pay a thing.

150
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,740
And now he's unreachable.

151
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:11,180
Her dad's been smoking
in the stairwell,

152
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,439
not saying a word.

153
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:23,800
I'm fine.

154
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:27,240
Just feeling a bit tired today.

155
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:34,393
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
